  "sourceTitle": "Ham Balls With Maple Syrup",
  "sourceText": "Ham Balls With Maple Syrup\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Saturday, December 5, 2009 - 11:57pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n3/4 lbs. ground ham\n3/4 lbs. ground pork\n1/2 cup fine bread crumbs\n1 egg, beaten\n1/2 cup milk\n1 cup maple syrup\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine all but the syrup, form into large balls. Pour syrup over and bake at 350 degrees for 1 hour. Turn once. Makes approximately 10 balls.",
